msgid "External LEDs"
msgstr "外部 LED"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:7
#: 2e8828a8c28142e394021ed12129adaa
msgid ""
"An external LED or LED Display can be added by connecting it to the "
"autopilot's I2C port or, in 4.0 and later versions, if a serially programmed"
" device, via an output using the SERVOx_FUNCTION for that output. DroneCAN "
"LEDs on the CANBUS are also supported (See :ref:`DroneCAN Setup <common-"
"uavcan-setup-advanced>` )."
msgstr ""
"可通过将外部 LED 或 LED 显示屏连接到飞控的 I2C 端口来添加；在 4.0 及更新版本中，如果是串行编程设备，也可以通过使用该输出的 "
"SERVOx_FUNCTION 经由输出连接。CAN 总线上的 DroneCAN LED 也受支持（参见 :ref:`DroneCAN 设置 "
"<common-uavcan-setup-advanced>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:10
#: d2be964b7d0c49d3b7524e339edb5157
msgid ""
"Note that the same grouping restrictions which apply to setting outputs to "
"different PWM rates and/or DShot, apply to LEDs also since the timer "
"associated with each group of outputs cannot be used for different rates. "
"See also  :ref:`Mixing ESC Protocols<mixing-escs>`"
msgstr ""
"请注意，将输出设置为不同 PWM 速率和/或 DShot 时适用的分组限制同样适用于 LED，因为每组输出关联的定时器不能用于不同速率。另请参阅 "
":ref:`混合 ESC 协议<mixing-escs>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:13
#: d4698bd261d84cbc8ca6db4cae0e641a
msgid "RGB LEDs/Displays with I2C Connection"
msgstr "I2C 连接的 RGB LED/显示屏"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:15
#: 1f98658ac6c14c2f95e88ae5044984cc
msgid ""
"Two types of I2C devices are supported: I2C connected RGB LEDS using an LED "
"driver chip and OLED displays."
msgstr "支持两种 I2C 设备：使用 LED 驱动芯片的 I2C 连接 RGB LED，以及 OLED 显示屏。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:17
#: 195f3f1d45864e3fa56b902cb81f9870
msgid "RGB LEDs/drivers supported are:"
msgstr "支持的 RGB LED/驱动器："

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:19
#: 1bd03ce6f8a74a138df5e1a17e9f52d5
msgid "Toshiba LEDs (no longer manufactured)"
msgstr "Toshiba LED（已停产）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:20
#: 7149e5b83bb04249b9af1beea2718959
msgid "PCA9685 driver"
msgstr "PCA9685 驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:21
#: 4bc9787078be457f9c49a49b2467737f
msgid "NCP5623 driver"
msgstr "NCP5623 驱动器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:23
#: b641c76daeea474da98dae6e589f9bfb
msgid ""
"OLED Displays supported are SSH1106 and SSD1306 with 128x64 pixel displays. "
"See :ref:`common-display-onboard` for more information."
msgstr ""
"支持的 OLED 显示屏为 SSH1106 和 SSD1306，分辨率为 128x64 像素。更多信息见 :ref:`common-display-"
"onboard`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:29
#: 9ff05ad226a94316b380b1e9992803f9
msgid ""
"Because most users use an external :ref:`GPS and Compass module <common-"
"positioning-landing-page>`, an I2C splitter is recommended, such as shown "
"below. The :ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` parameter should be set to "
"the controller type used."
msgstr ""
"由于大多数用户使用外置 :ref:`GPS 和罗盘模块 <common-positioning-landing-page>`，建议使用 I2C "
"分线器（如下图所示）。:ref:`NTF_LED_TYPES<NTF_LED_TYPES>` 参数应设置为所用控制器类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:35
#: c04e9d05a1214fd2b0eac1f028a35776
msgid "Serially Connected Devices"
msgstr "串行连接设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:37
#: 47671b7a3c4545d19fcddc33d1c4e25c
msgid ""
"Serial LEDs connected to an output require that the output be DMA capable "
"for proper operation. If the output is DShot capable, then its DMA capable. "
"Check the autopilot's documentation to determine if the output is DShot "
"capable,"
msgstr ""
"连接到输出的串行 LED 要求该输出具备 DMA 能力以正常工作。如果该输出支持 DShot，则其具备 DMA 能力。请查阅飞控文档确认输出是否支持 "
"DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:39
#: 1af311741162484480eebbb424e6255e
msgid ""
"Currently, ArduPilot supports Neopixel and ProfiLED RGB LED strings on the "
"autopilot's output using ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 120 thru 123. They can be used "
"for NTF notifications from the autopilot on status and warnings like other "
"RGB LEDs, or be programmed in unlimited ways using LUA scripts on the "
"autopilot's SD card. For use with scripting the output function must be set "
"to a scripting output function (94 - 109) the script then assigns this "
"output to LEDs. See :ref:`common-lua-scripts` for more use examples using "
"LUA scripts."
msgstr ""
"目前，ArduPilot 通过 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 120 至 123 支持飞控输出上的 NeoPixel 和 ProfiLED "
"RGB LED 灯带。它们可用于飞控发出 NTF 状态和警告通知（如其他 RGB LED），也可通过飞控 SD 卡上的 LUA "
"脚本进行任意编程。如用于脚本，输出功能必须设置为脚本输出功能（94-109），脚本再将该输出分配给 LED。更多使用 LUA 脚本的示例请见 "
":ref:`common-lua-scripts`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:43
#: cb762e5ffda2413e803f7bb75a8a7a9d
msgid ""
"Serial LEDs require a whole pwm group, more information about your "
"autopilot's PWM groups can be found on it's :ref:`hardware page<common-"
"autopilots>`. To check that the desired outputs have been setup correctly "
"look for the PWM types message in your GCS's messages tab. See :ref:`common-"
"gpios`"
msgstr ""
"串行 LED 需要占用整个 PWM 组，有关飞控 PWM 组的更多信息请在其 :ref:`硬件页面<common-autopilots>` "
"上查阅。要确认目标输出已正确设置，请在地面站的消息选项卡中查找 PWM 类型消息。参见 :ref:`common-gpios`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:51
#: a3a0eca2d7a94426bd7437a73e00374b
msgid ""
"Be sure the output is configures as normal PWM instead of a GPIO output. "
"Flight controllers with a IOMCU can only use the AUX outputs for connecting "
"serial LEDs. To check that the desired outputs have been setup correctly "
"look for the PWM types message in your GCS's messages tab. See :ref:`common-"
"gpios`"
msgstr ""
"请确保输出配置为普通 PWM，而非 GPIO 输出。带有 IOMCU 的飞控只能使用 AUX 输出连接串行 "
"LED。要确认目标输出已正确设置，请在地面站的消息选项卡中查找 PWM 类型消息。参见 :ref:`common-gpios`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:54
#: 9737ea82e0164297bfd6158d2e064592
msgid "NTF LED Meaning"
msgstr "NTF LED 含义"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:56
#: 5b0d01cf142941bd87b0a08affb90079
msgid ""
"The meaning of the colors and flash patterns are shown in :ref:`common-leds-"
"pixhawk` if the ``standard`` default protocol is set for "
":ref:`NTF_LED_OVERRIDE<NTF_LED_OVERRIDE>`."
msgstr ""
"当 :ref:`NTF_LED_OVERRIDE<NTF_LED_OVERRIDE>` 使用 ``standard`` "
"默认协议时，颜色和闪烁模式的含义见 :ref:`common-leds-pixhawk`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-external-leds.rst:58
#: ba159127758f43819c3efcd1749e0487
msgid ""
"The brightness and number of LEDs can be controlled by modifying the "
":ref:`NTF_LED_BRIGHT <NTF_LED_BRIGHT>` and :ref:`NTF_LED_LEN <NTF_LED_LEN>`"
msgstr ""
"可通过修改 :ref:`NTF_LED_BRIGHT <NTF_LED_BRIGHT>` 和 :ref:`NTF_LED_LEN "
"<NTF_LED_LEN>` 来控制亮度和 LED 数量"
